---
name: draft-section
description: Draft a paper section from experiment results and research notes
user-invocable: true
argument-hint: [section-name] [source-data-path]
---

You are helping draft a section of an academic paper.

1. Read the experiment results or research notes at the path: $1
2. Read the paper outline to understand where section "$0" fits
3. Draft the section in LaTeX format following these rules:
   - Academic survey tone, concise and evidence-driven
   - Every claim must have a \cite{} placeholder
   - Include \label{} for all sections/subsections
   - Flag any claims that need additional experiments with %% TODO: NEED EXPERIMENT
4. Save to the project's paragraph directory
5. List all references that need to be verified
